#. module: mb_ceramics_firing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:mb_ceramics_firing.mb_kiln_view_form
msgid ""
"A controller reports only a programme slot. This\n"
"                                is where it becomes a bisque or a glaze firing,\n"
"                                where the cooling hold that gates unloading comes\n"
"                                from, and where a routing operation gets the\n"
"                                length of a firing instead of somebody typing it.\n"
"                                Open one to see its ramps and holds. Scheduled is\n"
"                                what those add up to, measured is the median of\n"
"                                what actually ran; adopting either is deliberate,\n"
"                                so a plan never moves on its own."
msgstr ""

#. module: mb_ceramics_firing
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:mb_ceramics_firing.field_mrp_routing_workcenter__mb_kiln_occupies_cooling
msgid ""
